## Problem tree
- During brainstorming, when a sub-problem appears or gets resolved, use the problem-tree skill to update docs/superpowers/handoff/<topic>.md
- At the start of any session, check docs/superpowers/handoff/ for unfinished trees; if any, restate the status line before continuing
- When the design doc is written, paste the tree at its top and move the handoff file to handoff/done/

## 探索追蹤（problem-tree）
- brainstorming 進行中，子問題出現或有結論時，用 problem-tree skill 更新 docs/superpowers/handoff/<topic>.md
- 任何 session 開始前，先檢查 docs/superpowers/handoff/ 有沒有未完成的樹；有就先複述狀態列再繼續
- 設計文件寫出時，把樹貼進設計文件開頭，handoff 檔移到 handoff/done/
